{"seq":3,"slug":"fraud-loss-taxonomy-metrics","title":"欺诈损失分类与度量口径：申请欺诈、交易欺诈与损失归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/synthetic-identity-fraud-graph-detection/synthetic-identity-taxonomy/fraud-loss-taxonomy-metrics","wordCount":3023,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"欺诈损失分类与度量口径-申请欺诈-交易欺诈与损失归因\">欺诈损失分类与度量口径：申请欺诈、交易欺诈与损失归因</h1><p>一家跨境平台做季度风控复盘时，最先被问到的数字往往是「这个季度欺诈损失多少」。麻烦在于，同一次攻击在财务、风控、运营三本账上会得到三个不同的答案：财务看到的是<strong>核销后的净损失</strong>（扣除追回与拒付赢回的争议款），风控看到的是<strong>检出时的拦截金额</strong>，运营看到的是<strong>工单量与人工成本</strong>。三本账口径不统一，年复一年的「改善」就只是换了一把尺子。这一篇把「损失」拆成一套可对齐的定义树，并把申请欺诈、交易欺诈、first-party/bust-out 三类攻击分别落到可计量的指标上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-损失的定义树\">核心概念：损失的定义树</h2><p>欺诈损失的度量起点不是金额，而是**「谁在什么时候、因为哪一步失败、承担了多少钱」**。同一个 500 美元的未授权订单，若支付网关在授权阶段直接拒绝，损失是零；若放行后卡组织在拒付阶段判商户败诉，商户损失是 500 美元加 15–25 美元争议费；若发卡行把责任转移给卡组织、卡组织再向收单行清算，收单行还要加一层罚金。<strong>损失不是订单的属性，而是清算结果链上的累积</strong>。</p>\n<p>因此度量必须先固定三个正交维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生命周期阶段</strong>（申请 → 授权 → 结算 → 争议 → 追偿）：损失在哪一步被确认、在哪一步被冲销。</li>\n<li><strong>承担方</strong>（buyer / merchant / platform / acquirer / issuer / network）：跨境场景下平台常同时扮演收单方与担保方，责任边界更模糊。</li>\n<li><strong>确认口径</strong>（attempted / gross / net）：被拦下的尝试额、记账的毛损失、追回后的净损失。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三轴组合出的口径，才是后面所有指标的基础。国际公开统计都遵循类似分解——美国联邦贸易委员会（FTC）的 Consumer Sentinel Network Data Book 统计的是<strong>消费者自报损失额</strong>（来源：ftc.gov），英国金融业协会 UK Finance 的《Fraud – the facts》年度报告统计的是<strong>英国支付系统内的行业损失额</strong>，两者口径、分母、承担方完全不同，直接比较没有意义。<strong>先对口径，再比数字</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[欺诈尝试 attempted] --&gt; B{决策点}&#10;  B -- 拦截 --&gt; C[零损失&lt;br/&gt;记录拦截额与误杀成本]&#10;  B -- 放行 --&gt; D[记账毛损失 gross loss]&#10;  D --&gt; E{争议与追偿}&#10;  E -- 拒付赢回 --&gt; F[追回 recoveries]&#10;  E -- 拒付败诉 --&gt; G[损失 + 争议费 + 罚金]&#10;  E -- 无争议权&lt;br/&gt;礼物卡/即时到账 --&gt; H[直接核销]&#10;  F --&gt; I[净损失 net loss = gross - recoveries]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J{承担方}&#10;  J --&gt; K[merchant 承担]&#10;  J --&gt; L[platform 担保承担]&#10;  J --&gt; M[acquirer/issuer 依责任转移]&#10;  C --&gt; N[摩擦成本 friction cost&lt;br/&gt;误杀与人工审核]&#10;  N --&gt; O[总成本 total cost of fraud]&#10;  I --&gt; O\">graph TD\n  A[欺诈尝试 attempted] --&gt; B{决策点}\n  B -- 拦截 --&gt; C[零损失&lt;br/&gt;记录拦截额与误杀成本]\n  B -- 放行 --&gt; D[记账毛损失 gross loss]\n  D --&gt; E{争议与追偿}\n  E -- 拒付赢回 --&gt; F[追回 recoveries]\n  E -- 拒付败诉 --&gt; G[损失 + 争议费 + 罚金]\n  E -- 无争议权&lt;br/&gt;礼物卡/即时到账 --&gt; H[直接核销]\n  F --&gt; I[净损失 net loss = gross - recoveries]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J{承担方}\n  J --&gt; K[merchant 承担]\n  J --&gt; L[platform 担保承担]\n  J --&gt; M[acquirer/issuer 依责任转移]\n  C --&gt; N[摩擦成本 friction cost&lt;br/&gt;误杀与人工审核]\n  N --&gt; O[总成本 total cost of fraud]\n  I --&gt; O</pre><p>图上最关键的一条边是 <code>C → N</code>：<strong>拦截不是免费的</strong>。误杀一笔真实订单，损失的是这笔订单的毛利，加上被拒买家的流失概率。LexisNexis Risk Solutions 的《True Cost of Fraud》系列研究长期用一个「成本乘数」刻画这件事——每 1 美元的欺诈损失，商户端实际承担的总成本通常是该金额的数倍（来源：LexisNexis Risk Solutions，True Cost of Fraud 年度研究）。把摩擦成本排除在损失之外，是风控团队最常见的自欺。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三轴切分-申请欺诈-账户接管与交易欺诈\">三轴切分：申请欺诈、账户接管与交易欺诈</h2><p>行业习惯按<strong>攻击发生在生命周期的哪一段</strong>来分类，而不是按攻击手法。这样切分的好处是：每一类的损失承担方、数据可得性、可拦截点都不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>攻击时点</th>\n<th>典型手法</th>\n<th>主要损失承担方</th>\n<th>关键检测信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>申请欺诈 application fraud</td>\n<td>开户/注册/授信</td>\n<td>伪造或合成身份通过 KYC</td>\n<td>平台授信方 / 发卡行</td>\n<td>身份要素一致性、设备与人口统计异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账户接管 ATO</td>\n<td>账户已存在</td>\n<td>凭据填充、SIM 交换、钓鱼</td>\n<td>平台（担保方）+ 持卡人</td>\n<td>登录地理/设备突变、凭据变更后立即消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交易欺诈 transaction fraud</td>\n<td>已授权账户</td>\n<td>盗卡 CNP、拒付套利</td>\n<td>商户 / 收单方（无 3DS 时）</td>\n<td>卡 BIN 与收货地不一致、速度规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>first-party fraud</td>\n<td>本人真实身份</td>\n<td>「我未授权」谎报、退货欺诈</td>\n<td>商户 / 平台</td>\n<td>历史行为基线、退货率与拒付率联合异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合成身份 bust-out</td>\n<td>长期养号后爆发</td>\n<td>养信用额度后集中提现/套现</td>\n<td>授信方为主</td>\n<td>身份簇的共同元素、额度使用曲线的拐点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最容易被误分类的是<strong>合成身份</strong>。它既可能是申请欺诈（用假身份开户），也可能是 first-party 欺诈（真人配合使用）——业界把它单列，是因为它的<strong>损失曲线在时间上高度非线性</strong>：前 6–18 个月是「养号期」，账户表现优良、几乎零损失；随后在数天到数周内集中爆发（bust-out），把累积的授信额度、退款额度、卖家保证金一次性抽干。美联储在《Synthetic Identity Fraud in the U.S. Payment System》白皮书（来源：federalreserve.gov）中把它列为支付系统结构性风险，原因正是这种<strong>时滞导致的度量盲区</strong>：只用滚动 30 天损失率监控的团队，在养号期看到的是一片平静。</p>\n<p>一张真实身份、一个合成身份、以及一个「真人 + 合成身份」的混合簇，在图上往往共享手机号、设备指纹、收货地址或收款账户。这正是身份图谱要解决的部分，而本文只关心：一旦识别出簇，损失该怎么归到簇、归到人、归到阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"损失归因-从毛损失到净损失的推导链\">损失归因：从毛损失到净损失的推导链</h2><p>把损失归到正确的承担方，需要一条可以逐步验证的等式链。以单笔交易为单位：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>gross</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>recovery</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>dispute</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>penalty</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>chargeback_win</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{net}} = L_{\\text{gross}} - R_{\\text{recovery}} + C_{\\text{dispute}} + C_{\\text{penalty}} - R_{\\text{chargeback\\_win}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gross</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recovery</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispute</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">penalty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chargeback_win</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>gross</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{gross}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gross</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该笔的记账金额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>recovery</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{recovery}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recovery</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是资金或货物追回，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>dispute</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{dispute}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispute</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是争议处理费（卡组织与收单行各自收取，通常在 15–35 美元区间），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>penalty</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{penalty}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">penalty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是超限罚金，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>chargeback_win</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{chargeback\\_win}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">chargeback_win</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是争议胜诉后回收的金额。四项不是常数：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>recovery</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{recovery}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recovery</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取决于是否跨境、是否有本地追偿渠道；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>penalty</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{penalty}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">penalty</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取决于是否触发卡组织的争议监控计划——Visa 的 Dispute Monitoring Program（VDMP）与 Mastercard 的 Excessive Chargeback Program 都对<strong>商户维度的争议比率与争议量</strong>设阈值，超过后进入罚金区间（来源：Visa / Mastercard 商户争议监控计划公开规则）。这意味着<strong>同一笔损失在不同商户维度上的边际成本不同</strong>：一个已经进入监控的商户，再多一笔拒付可能触发整月的罚金，而一个干净商户只是多一笔核销。</p>\n<p>聚类到身份或商户维度后，损失率用基点表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>FLR</mtext><mtext>bps</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>processed</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FLR}_{\\text{bps}} = \\frac{L_{\\text{net}}}{V_{\\text{processed}}} \\times 10^{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FLR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">bps</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">processed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>processed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{processed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">processed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的选择直接决定数字大小：用 GMV、用授权通过额、还是用结算净额，结果能差出 20%–40%。跨境电商尤其要注意<strong>退货与取消</strong>：若分母含已退货订单，而分子只含净损失，比率会被系统性低估。行业内可比的基准通常按「授权通过金额」或「净结算额」计，报告时必须写明。</p>\n<p>风险定价视角下还有一层：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EL</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>PD</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>EAD</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>LGD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EL} = \\text{PD} \\times \\text{EAD} \\times \\text{LGD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EL</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EAD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LGD</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在授信类产品里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span></span></span></span></span>（违约/欺诈概率）由身份簇风险分估计，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EAD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EAD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EAD</span></span></span></span></span></span>（违约暴露）由已用额度决定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LGD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LGD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LGD</span></span></span></span></span></span>（违约损失率）由追偿能力决定。合成身份 bust-out 的可怕之处在于三个量在爆发时<strong>同时跳变</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 从接近零突增，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EAD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EAD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EAD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 因养号期额度被逐步抬高而处于高位，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LGD</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LGD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LGD</span></span></span></span></span></span> 因身份是假的、几乎无追偿可能而接近 1。三者相乘，单簇损失可以远超其历史累计贡献之和。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量指标-检出率-误杀率与全成本\">度量指标：检出率、误杀率与全成本</h2><p>风控指标必须成对出现，单独看任何一个都会被刷。以下是跨境平台统一口径后常用的一组，所有比率都应绑定同一分子/分母定义与同一观察窗口。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>常见陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>损失率 bps</td>\n<td>净损失 / 处理金额</td>\n<td>分母换口径即可「改善」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检出率 recall</td>\n<td>真欺诈中被拦截的比例</td>\n<td>依赖事后标签，标签延迟 30–120 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拦截精确率 precision</td>\n<td>被拦截中确认为真欺诈的比例</td>\n<td>无人工复核时被高估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误杀率 false positive rate</td>\n<td>被拒的真实交易 / 真实交易</td>\n<td>只看拒绝率会掩盖误杀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>摩擦成本</td>\n<td>误杀损失毛利 + 人工审核工时 + 客户流失</td>\n<td>最常被漏记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位识别成本</td>\n<td>风控总投入 / 确认的欺诈簇数</td>\n<td>图计算成本常被摊进「研发」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全成本恒等式把上面几项收口：</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>friction</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>infra</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{total}} = L_{\\text{net}} + C_{\\text{friction}} + C_{\\text{ops}} + C_{\\text{infra}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">friction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">infra</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>total</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 下降时，一次风控改造才算成功。</strong> 一个只降低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{net}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 但把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>friction</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{friction}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">friction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 抬高一倍的规则，是把损失从风控账挪到了业务账——这是几乎所有「加严规则」方案的默认结局。评价时还应区分<strong>检出率</strong>与<strong>提前检出率</strong>：对 bust-out 而言，在爆发前一天识别与在爆发后识别，损失差可达两个数量级，因此需要引入「提前量」指标（平均在爆发前多少小时命中）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"first-party-与-bust-out-的归因难点\">first-party 与 bust-out 的归因难点</h2><p>first-party 欺诈（买家本人下真单后谎报未授权、或恶意退货套利）在度量上有一个结构性困难：<strong>没有外部基准</strong>。卡组织拒付可以查原因码，本人在平台内部的「我未收到货」主张只能靠内部证据链。平台的应对往往是把成本转嫁给卖家，但平台上同时存在<strong>卖家侧的 bust-out</strong>（卖家长期刷单养信誉、累积保证金与账期后卷款关店），两类 first-party 行为的损失在总账上会互相污染。</p>\n<p>工程上的解法是把归因做到<strong>主体粒度</strong>而非订单粒度：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每个损失事件绑定一个<strong>主体</strong>（买家账户、卖家店铺、或身份簇）与一个<strong>确认时点</strong>。</li>\n<li>主体上的损失做<strong>滚动归集</strong>，允许迟到的争议在归集窗口内回填（跨境争议可能 90–120 天后才结案）。</li>\n<li>归集结果同时驱动<strong>准备金</strong>：准备金不是按 GMV 的固定比例计提，而应按主体风险分层的期望损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EL</span></span></span></span></span></span> 计提，让 bust-out 的高尾风险在养号期就开始占用资本。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>做到这一步，「损失」才从一个财务事后数字，变成一个能在爆发前发出信号的<strong>前向指标</strong>。这也解释了为什么合成身份检测的评估绝不能只用静态的点损失率——评估集必须包含足够长的养号期历史，否则模型只会学到「大额交易可疑」这种在 bust-out 前完全失效的特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>损失的度量起点是「谁、在哪个阶段、承担了多少」，而非金额本身；口径不对齐时，跨机构、跨时间的比较全部无效。</li>\n<li>三条正交轴：生命周期阶段、承担方、确认口径（attempted / gross / net），FTC、UK Finance 等公开统计口径互不相同。</li>\n<li>交易损失要到<strong>清算结果链</strong>上结账：核销额、争议费、罚金、追偿赢回四项都要计入，边际成本随商户争议监控状态变化。</li>\n<li>全成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>friction</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ops</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>infra</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{total}} = L_{\\text{net}} + C_{\\text{friction}} + C_{\\text{ops}} + C_{\\text{infra}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">friction</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ops</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">infra</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\